/-!
# Segmented inverse (S2): complex form, in the contract of `Japprox_bound`

`N` is real, so `segInvC` treats the real and imaginary parts separately. `segInvC_err`: if
`w l + Eexact s t α w l = v l` (the exact resampling system of `KFMBaseJap.Japprox_bound`, which the
segmented inverse replaces) and `U ≈ 2^P v` (both parts, `ε_in`), then each part of
`segInvC U` is within `60 G/2^P + 12 e^{-πα²w(w+1)}(Bu+1) + (8/7)ε_in` of `2^P w`, and
